# base/ — Database & Infrastructure Layer
# =========================================
# This folder centralises everything related to data persistence,
# schemas, SQL migrations, and infrastructure config for REKOV.
#
# Structure:
#
#   base/
#   ├── __init__.py           ← exposes get_db, Base, engine
#   ├── database.py           ← SQLAlchemy engine + session setup
#   ├── models.py             ← All ORM table models (TicketModel, etc.)
#   ├── schemas/              ← Pydantic request/response schemas
#   │   ├── kiosk.py
#   │   └── auth.py
#   ├── migrations/           ← SQL migration scripts (run in order)
#   │   └── 001_initial.sql
#   └── seeds/                ← Optional seed / fixture data
#       └── departments.json
